1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,917
Harbour City 3, Northgate Rovers 3:
one simulated match.

2
00:00:03,967 --> 00:00:07,733
Pivot finds the moments that turned it,
explains why,

3
00:00:07,783 --> 00:00:11,550
and lets you replay it
with one thing changed.

4
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:14,150
Pivot found three turning points.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,020
Take Anbel's goal at 35 minutes.

6
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:20,710
A Judge agent confirms
it really swung the game.

7
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,350
An Explainer writes why.

8
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:26,040
A Verifier recomputes every number
from the event log:

9
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:30,550
Northgate's passes into the final third
went from zero to four.

10
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:34,810
Now switch to Fan
and pick Harbour City.

11
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:38,984
Same moment, same checked facts,
told from your side:

12
00:00:39,034 --> 00:00:42,231
"Harbour City lose grip
after Northgate's second."

13
00:00:42,281 --> 00:00:44,550
In Chinese or Spanish, too.

14
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,421
Follow a player.

15
00:00:46,471 --> 00:00:50,825
Miquingorini scored a hat-trick
and is rated 9.3.

16
00:00:50,875 --> 00:00:56,550
You get his shots, his heatmap
and his part in each turning point.

17
00:00:57,150 --> 00:01:01,016
So what if his equaliser
had been ruled out?

18
00:01:01,066 --> 00:01:07,978
Pivot saves the match at that minute
and plays the rest 200 times each way.

19
00:01:08,028 --> 00:01:14,069
Northgate's chance of winning doubles,
from 26 to 53 percent.

20
00:01:14,119 --> 00:01:17,550
The ranges don't overlap.
It's a clear difference.

21
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:21,003
Every match replays on the pitch,

22
00:01:21,053 --> 00:01:25,357
with passes, shots and tackles
drawn as they happen.

23
00:01:25,407 --> 00:01:30,679
Set pieces too: his first goal
came from a free kick,

24
00:01:30,729 --> 00:01:34,550
three attackers against eight defenders,
all three man-marked.

25
00:01:35,150 --> 00:01:39,119
Before kick-off: third against fifth,
two points apart, the storylines,

26
00:01:39,169 --> 00:01:45,550
and each coach's plan: a defensive 4-3-3
against a balanced 4-2-3-1.

27
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:49,026
The agents run on Azure AI Foundry.

28
00:01:49,076 --> 00:01:52,788
Results live in Cosmos DB,
matches in Blob Storage.

29
00:01:52,838 --> 00:01:55,296
Every club and player is synthetic.

30
00:01:55,346 --> 00:01:56,550
This is Pivot.
